# CODEOWNERS
#
# This is currently a team of one developer, so nothing here is enforced yet —
# GitHub's "require review from Code Owners" branch protection needs a second
# reviewer to mean anything. This file is kept up to date anyway so that
# turning it on later is a config flip, not a rewrite. Team handles below are
# PLACEHOLDERS (@sentinelai/*) — replace with real GitHub teams when the team
# actually grows. Ownership is grouped into a handful of squads that each own
# a cluster of related modules, not one team per module — see
# docs/architecture.md ("Team Ownership") for the rationale.

# Architecturally significant / cross-cutting — changes here affect everyone
/docs/                                 @sentinelai/architecture-guild
/CLAUDE.md                             @sentinelai/architecture-guild
/CONTRIBUTING.md                       @sentinelai/architecture-guild
/.github/CODEOWNERS                    @sentinelai/architecture-guild

